      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "An evening of unnerving, terrifying and  true  tales from the grave and beyond.   Featuring your favourite undead, mostly dead, and totally dead-dead locally sourced spine-tingling dread masters of chilling horror.  (Must show evidence of at least two jabs for entry. And of  course  there will be ma"
