    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Tickets:   $15 Running Time:   45 - 60 minutes Improv Comedy Rating:   Adults Only - not appropriate for children  Boydream is a Vancouver based, story focused improv duo. Brad Bergeron and Corey Schmitt have been doing comedy together for over 7 years and have honed in on their style with Boydream."
