      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Join us on Sunday, August 10th @ 8PM at the Sunset Theatre for a Harp Concert hosted by our friends at  Island Mountain Arts  and performed by Harp Instructor, Sharlene Wallace.    Tickets are: $25 for Adults/$20 for IMA &amp; Sunset Theatre Member    PWYC (Pay What You Can) at the Door for Age"
