      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Written and performed by Emma Jarrett, featuring original artwork and projections by Sarah Guest.   “A wry, poetic yet unflinching story of loss and retrieval.”    “Brave, surprising and beatiful – wild and wolf-like.” – Doon Mackichan, Bafta Award winner   Originally developed through the Sunset’s"
