      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Trista Bassett and John Fraser blend classic folk with a tiny pinch of country and a sprinkling of rock. Come back July 23rd for  a night of the music of John Prine, delivered in the musical culinary style of Small kitchen Chaos."
      }
