      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Written and Directed by Ryan Gladstone  Starring Tara Travis  Original Score by Drew Jurecka and Robbie Grunwald    The Betrayed Wife. The Scheming Wife. The Peacemaker. The Ugly German. The Tarty One. The One in Love with Someone Else.  Six Queens. &nbsp;Six Love stories. &nbsp;Six Deaths."
      }
