    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "A christmas cornucopia of amazing music, hilarious sketch comedy, and spirit!   Tickets are $20/each  The show is 2 Acts @ 45 minutes per act + 1 intermission @ 15 to 20 minutes  Last year’s Christmas Cabaret sold out so buy early and GET YOUR TICKETS TODAY!    Buy Here Today!"
