      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "We kick off our 2nd Annual SpeakEasy Festival with our always popular Sunset Cabaret. An evening of song and sketch comedy, all written and performed by local actors and musicians, and visiting artists for the SpeakEasy Festival.   Showtime starts at 8PM - 2 acts @ 45 minutes each then we end the ev"
