        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "We are thrilled to be hosting Molly Wilson and her Comedy Cabaret! Join us for a very fun evening of comedy and song with this captivating performer!  A hilarious musical variety show sure to delight you with a splash of comedy, a shot of zaniness, and a large pour of your favourite songs from Pop,"
      }
