        "@value": "Tickets:   $20.00 Showtime:   7:00PM - 9:00PM   Opening Act:   Bob Campbell • Local Yocal   We are thrilled to have the very talented Yael Wand back on the Sunset Stage after quite a few years. She just released her 4th album, Saltwater Heartwood, and she’ll be touring BC this summer. We are very lu"
