      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "As of November 23, 2020 the BC Government has put a restriction on public gatherings. As a result, we have had to close our doors for all Live Performances and Film Screenings. We will update this page with any new information about when we can re-open for live performance and film after the next BC"
