        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Tickets:   $10 Running Time:   2 hours 22 minutes Rating:   R Genre:   Mystery, Thriller, Horror  Jack Torrance (Jack Nicholson) becomes winter caretaker at the isolated Overlook Hotel in Colorado, hoping to cure his writer's block. He settles in along with his wife, Wendy (Shelley Duvall), and his"
