        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Tickets:   $5.00 Running Time:   1 hour &amp; 28 minutes   Filmmaker Neil Berkeley documents the life and times of Wayne White - an American artist, art director, puppeteer, set designer, animator, cartoonist and illustrator. He has won three Emmy Awards for his work.&nbsp;  Genre:   Comedy,"
      }
