        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Tickets:   $5.00 Running Time:   1 hour and 37 minutes  Join us tonight, Monday, September 28 @ 8PM as we join so many people around the world to commemorate the life of the extraordinary Supreme Court Justice Ruth Bader Ginsburg, the “notorious RBG”.   An intimate portrait of an unlikely rock star:"
