        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Barkerville Gold Mines will be hosting a Community Discussion on September 22, 2020 from 6-8pm regarding the Cariboo Gold Project. The event will be held both in person, at the Sunset Theatre in Wells, as well as virtually on Zoom.    As the Sunset Theatre’s Covid19 Protocols limit seating capacity,"
