        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "We are re-opening on Thursday, July 16, 2020. See even listing below for details and to pre-book your tickets. Here is a bit of information regarding re-opening protocols:   WORKSAFE BC • COVID 19 PROTOCOLS FOR THE SUNSET THEATRE  NEW CAPACITY • The Sunset Theatre will have a maximum capacity of 20"
