        "@value": "This event is put on by the Wells and Area Trails Society (WATS). Join your host Dave at the Sunset Theatre, for popcorn, an array of drinks, and inspirational, outdoorsy films, compiled from over 10 years of film festivals!   TICKETS: $15   Tickets can be reserved by website (wellstrails.ca) or con"
